! This is the "day minus one" state: a field tech consoled
! in, set a hostname, and left. No routing, no interface
! config, no management story. Your ZTP service replaces
! all of this — do not configure the switch by hand.
! -------------------------------------------------------
!
spanning-tree mode mstp
!
interface Ethernet1
   description to ztp1 (provisioning segment)
!
interface Ethernet2
   description to h1 (user segment)
!
